---
layout: "layouts/marketing.hbs"
permalink: "/case-studies.html"
tags:
  - "publicPage"
title: "Case studies"
style: "journal"
description: "Worked email-system designs with fictional companies: self-managed mail servers, enterprise applications and customer-specific SMTP services."
---
    <section class="journal-index">
      <div class="shell">
        <header class="journal-index-header">
          <h1>Case studies</h1>
          <a class="journal-index-link" href="{{site.journal.indexUrl}}">Engineering Journal</a>
        </header>

        <p class="journal-index-intro">These are worked examples with fictional companies, not customer stories. Each has a different mail setup and a different set of problems to solve.</p>

        <div class="case-study-grid">
          {{#each collections.caseStudies}}
            <article class="case-study-card">
              <a class="case-study-card-link" href="{{this.url}}" aria-labelledby="case-study-company-{{@index}}" aria-describedby="case-study-label-{{@index}}">
                <span class="case-study-label" id="case-study-label-{{@index}}">{{data.caseStudy.label}}</span>
                <h2 id="case-study-company-{{@index}}">
                  {{#if data.caseStudy.logo}}
                    <img class="case-study-logo" src="{{data.caseStudy.logo}}" alt="{{data.caseStudy.company}}" width="600" height="200" decoding="async">
                  {{else}}
                    {{data.caseStudy.company}}
                  {{/if}}
                </h2>
                <p>{{data.caseStudy.description}}</p>
                <span class="case-study-card-title">
                  <span>{{data.title}}</span>
                  <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                </span>
              </a>
            </article>
          {{else}}
            <p>The first case studies are still being written. In the meantime, you can read the <a href="{{site.journal.indexUrl}}">Engineering Journal</a> or find a guide for <a href="/use-cases.html">common email jobs</a>.</p>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
